--[[
    Universal Silent Aim  •  WindUI  •  Mobile Edition  (Silent Aim only)
    ===================================================================
    A focused, silent-aim-only build on the WindUI library, mobile-first.
    No ESP, no triggerbot — just clean, accurate aim redirection.

    Core
      • __namecall + __index hooks (Raycast, FindPartOnRay family,
        Mouse.Hit / Mouse.Target) with strict typeof validation
      • Per-frame target cache — one selection per frame feeds every ray,
        so there is zero flicker and no wasted work in the hook path

    Targeting
      • Selection modes: Cursor FOV · Screen Center · Closest Distance ·
        Lowest Health
      • Sticky target (hold a target until it dies or leaves range)
      • Team check · wall/visibility check · alive check · max distance
      • Player whitelist (never target friends)

    Aim assist
      • Velocity prediction (lead moving targets) with ping compensation
      • Adjustable hit chance

    Visuals (aim-only)
      • FOV circle: center or cursor, filled, rainbow, custom sides
      • On-screen target marker

    Quality of life
      • Per-game config save / load
      • Draggable on-screen AIM button (pure touch, no keyboard)
      • Everything guarded so thin mobile executors degrade gracefully

    UI : WindUI  (https://github.com/Footagesus/WindUI)
    Credits : Averiias, Stefanuk12, xaxa (original silent-aim concept)
--]]

